----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
|          Ideograph          |           Connotation            |                              Elucidation                              |       Example       |
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
|       亻 as component        |       general derived set        |Returns a new list with elements produced from the original input list.| 伄 攸 𰂋 偏 􏾜 􏾛 偅 𠆯 􏹈 􏷍?|
|                             |                                  |      (Implies the input data and output data are the same type.)      |                     |
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
|       阝 as component        |          serial subset           |   Returns a new list with elements serially produced from the input   |        􏴛 􏾺 􏴌        |
|                             |                                  |   list.(Implies the input data and output data are the same type.)    |                     |
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
|       􏴗 as component        |the rest part of the serial subset|   Returns a new list with elements serially produced from the input   |      􏾝 􏹋 􏳹 􏳸 􏺊      |
|                             |                                  |   list.(Implies the input data and output data are the same type.)    |                     |
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
|       刂 as component        |          broken subset           |  Returns a new list with removing some elements from the input list.  |       􏾘 𠝤 􏹊 􏹇       |
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
|       􏴺 as component        |          sectional sets          | split the input list to sections or rearrange it to many related sets |       􏳷 􏳶 􏳳 􏳰       |
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
|入 as component or 入 as suffix|        function as input         |              Implies the type of input data is function.              |    􏹃 􏹅 􏹌 􏹂 􏳭 􏴁 􏳾    |
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
|            *SFX             |            strengthen            |Strengthen the process, thus the data of output may become longer, and |      弓* 􏹂* 􏼏*       |
|                             |                                  |                 the type may be changed accordingly.                  |                     |
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
|            ~SFX             |              soften              |           Soften the process, thus the output data shorter.           |        􏹊~ 􏹇~        |
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
|            ^SFX             |          list as input           |                Implies the type of input data is list.                |      􏹊^ 伄^ 􏾘^       |
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
|            ?SFX             |        boolean as output         |              Implies the type of output data is boolean.              |      双? 􏿴? 􏿳?       |
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
